# Keep only the distributable plugin and its documentation.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/edge/
!/figma/
!/licenses/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.log
**/.env*
**/credentials*
**/secrets*

# Current source backup (local registrations and credentials excluded)
!/AI拆图助手/
!/技能包/
**/runtime.local.json
**/native-host.json
**/native-host.cmd
**/service.json
**/auth.json
**/依赖/
**/运行临时/
!/源码备份说明.md

# User artwork and generated demo outputs are not source backups.
/AI拆图助手/插件程序/示例/

# Machine state, private registrations and user data never enter source backup.
**/测试结果/
**/运行/
**/工程文件/
**/desktop.ini
**/*.lnk
**/runtime.local.json*
**/native-host.json*
**/native-host.cmd*
**/service.json*
**/assistant-taishi.local.json*
**/credentials.json*
**/token.json*
**/auth.json*
